{"level":30,"time":1778519965623,"pid":86444,"hostname":"Williams-MacBook-Pro.local","step":"review-runs","item":"1.md","index":6,"runIndex":"run-2","type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_01Bb4K7Q3WyPsVqt4H4p9i8H","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Good! I can see that:\n\n1. **Sheet 31 (Landscape Plan) Block 2** mentions: \"Utility lines such as water (W), storm drain (SD), and overhead electric (OHE)\" are shown on the drawing.\n\n2. **Sheet 9 (Site Plan) Block 5** mentions: \"Additional electric easements may be required at a later date.\"\n\nSo there ARE overhead electric lines mentioned on the plans. However, I need to look more carefully at whether these are existing overhead electric facilities or proposed. The reference in Sheet 31 to \"overhead electric (OHE)\" suggests existing utilities are shown on the landscape plan.\n\nNow I need to use the vision check tool to examine the site plan and landscape plan to see:\n- Are there overhead electric lines/poles shown?\n- What are their locations relative to buildings, driveways, parking, and other site features?\n- Are clearance dimensions shown?\n- What about trees and landscaping near these lines?\n\nLet me use vision_check to examine whether overhead electric facilities are actually shown on the site plans.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":7,"cache_creation_input_tokens":5632,"cache_read_input_tokens":46920,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":5632},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"5bdd8a02-49ee-4d1f-8b8c-60e98c23c29e","uuid":"e69d2264-ec0d-4247-829f-9c0d5fed7afe"}
