{"level":30,"time":1778520182228,"pid":86444,"hostname":"Williams-MacBook-Pro.local","step":"review-runs","item":"1.md","index":3,"runIndex":"run-1","type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_01NU98NLse1W9rUyJXEFKCNj","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Great! In the legend on Sheet 4 (Existing Conditions Survey), I can see:\n- Line 57: \"UTILITY POLE\" (symbol)\n- Line 67: \"O.H.U.L. OVERHEAD UTILITY LINE\" (symbol)\n- Line 76: \"TRANSFORMER ON PAD\" (symbol)\n\nSo the survey includes symbols for overhead utility lines and utility poles. However, the blocks.md doesn't explicitly tell me if these features are actually shown on the property. I need to use the vision check tool to examine the actual drawing to see if overhead utility lines or poles are depicted on the existing conditions survey.\n\nLet me check the site plan (Sheet 9) to see what's shown there.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":7,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2697,"cache_read_input_tokens":44637,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2697},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"18361ddd-02f6-4450-868d-9cbeabd274bb","uuid":"63e5dcd4-e768-407b-b0c5-97d851e1829d"}
