nBuildings **1, 2, 7, and 8** are located near the overhead electric lines, with Building 8 being situated closest to the corner where the western and southern utility lines intersect. Buildings 3, 4, 5, and 6 are positioned in the interior or eastern/northern portions of the site, away from the marked `---OHE---` lines."}]}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"18361ddd-02f6-4450-868d-9cbeabd274bb","uuid":"c01b93e5-bc7f-4014-ab5e-ec56f5decff8","tool_use_result":[{"type":"text","text":"Based on the provided site plan, the overhead electric lines (designated by lines labeled `---OHE---`) are located along the western perimeter (running north-south) and the southern perimeter (running east-west) of the site. \n\nHere is the spatial relationship and general location of the overhead electric lines relative to each proposed building:\n\n*   **Bldg. 1**: Located in the northwest corner of the site. The overhead lines run north-south along the western boundary, **west** of the building.\n*   **Bldg. 2**: Located on the mid-west side of the site. The overhead lines run north-south along the western boundary, **west** of the building.\n*   **Bldg. 3**: Located in the north-central area of the site. **Not located near** the overhead electric lines.\n*   **Bldg. 4**: Located in the center of the site. **Not located near** the overhead electric lines.\n*   **Bldg. 5**: Located in the northeast corner of the site. **Not located near** the overhead electric lines.\n*   **Bldg. 6**: Located on the mid-east side of the site. **Not located near** the overhead electric lines. *(Note: There is a \"5' Electric Easement\" noted near the eastern boundary adjacent to Bldg. 6, but no corresponding overhead lines are drawn/labeled in that specific area).*\n*   **Bldg. 7**: Located in the south-central/southeast area of the site. The overhead lines run east-west along the southern property boundary, **south** of the building.\n*   **Bldg. 8**: Located in the southwest corner of the site.