clude Cedar Elm, Live Oak, Mexican Redbud, Texas Mountain Laurel, Obedient Plant, Frogfruit - but no verification against utility-compatible list provided\n   \n7. **Clearance Distances**: Measuring from the site plan, Buildings 1, 2, 7, and 8 all maintain distances of 27.8 to 86.2 feet from the overhead lines, which exceeds the 7.5-foot minimum requirement. However, these measurements aren't explicitly documented on the plans themselves, which is the actual compliance issue. I should verify the landscape details on Sheet 35 next.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":7,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1762,"cache_read_input_tokens":66721,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1762},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"18361ddd-02f6-4450-868d-9cbeabd274bb","uuid":"559ff377-f9e0-4884-807d-2217f977d6eb"}
