{"level":30,"time":1778523689101,"pid":86444,"hostname":"Williams-MacBook-Pro.local","step":"review-runs","item":"1.md","index":3,"runIndex":"run-1","type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_01G6KUut2wjdjHDwGkqcdfVr","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I have completed the comprehensive site plan review for the **Site Feature Clearances from Overhead Electric Lines** grouping. Here's a summary of my findings:\n\n## Review Summary\n\n**Project:** Valley View Townhomes (39-sheet site plan + supplementary docs)  \n**Grouping:** EL-MD-EXP 1 — Site Feature Clearances from Overhead Electric Lines\n\n### Applicability Determination\n**✓ APPLICABLE** — Overhead electric lines and poles confirmed on and adjacent to the property. Buildings, structures, utilities, and landscaping are proposed within the development, triggering clearance requirements.\n\n### Key Findings\n\n**Overhead Electric Infrastructure Confirmed:**\n- North-south overhead line along Valley View Road (western boundary)\n- East-west branch line along southern boundary  \n- Multiple utility poles on property\n- Buildings 1, 2, 7, 8 located 27-86 feet from overhead lines\n\n### Results Summary\nOf 47 checklist items evaluated:\n\n| Status | Count | Items |\n|--------|-------|-------|\n| **PASS** | 10 | Items where requirement is met |\n| **FAIL** | 10 | Critical documentation deficiencies |\n| **NOT-VERIFIABLE** | 17 | Insufficient documentation to verify compliance |\n| **N/A** | 10 | Requirement does not apply to this project |\n\n### Critical Deficiencies (FAIL Status)\n1. **EL-1.7** — No building elevation sheets with surveyed conductor elevations\n2. **EL-1.8** — No dimension annotations showing clearance from conductors to buildings\n3. **EL-1.9** — Property line fences appear to not maintain 7.5-foot clearance from overhead lines\n4. **EL-1.17** — Retaining wall sections lack clearance dimensions from overhead conductors\n5. **EL-1.18** — Driveways lack vertical clearance dimensions (16-18 feet requirement)\n6. **EL-1.19** — Parking areas lack vertical clearance verification from overhead lines\n7. **EL-1.31** — No registered surveyor survey of pole locations and mid-span clearances\n8. **EL-1.37** — Proposed trees not verified against ECM Appendix F Utility Compatible list\n9. **EL-1.45** — Construction staging areas not coordinated with 10-foot overhead line safety clearances\n10. **EL-1.46** — Missing required 48-hour notification note to Austin Energy before construction near high-voltage lines\n\n### Major Gaps Requiring Resolution\n- **Surveyed conductor elevations** needed to verify vertical clearances\n- **Clearance dimension callouts** required on all plan and section views\n- **Utility compatibility** of proposed tree species must be documented\n- **Construction safety plan** must establish overhead line clearance zones\n- **Property line fence alignment** must be verified/relocated to maintain clearances\n- **Easement coordination** needed for items within electric easements\n\nAll detailed findings, evidence locations, code citations, and remediation requirements are provided in the structured output above."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":7,"cache_creation_input_tokens":17689,"cache_read_input_tokens":71728,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":17689},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"18361ddd-02f6-4450-868d-9cbeabd274bb","uuid":"c54d1dc4-f795-4a3f-a692-d0897f8a189e"}
