{"level":30,"time":1778523704902,"pid":86444,"hostname":"Williams-MacBook-Pro.local","step":"review-runs","item":"1.md","index":6,"runIndex":"run-2","type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_015bRHq8kExWmZPCMJ3kcPEn","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"This is helpful! The vision check returned measurements showing:\n1. Trees labeled \"M\" (mitigation trees) are positioned near the overhead electric line\n2. One easternmost tree labeled \"M\" is only 0.5 feet from the OHE line - essentially on it!\n3. Other mitigation trees are 72.4, 110.6, and 155.3 feet away\n\nBut I need to know:\n1. What species these trees are\n2. Whether they are utility-compatible (UC) species\n\nThe vision check only told me about distance, not species. Let me search for the tree list and plant schedule to see what species are planted and whether they have UC designation.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":7,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2170,"cache_read_input_tokens":64160,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2170},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"5bdd8a02-49ee-4d1f-8b8c-60e98c23c29e","uuid":"89c09108-6cb3-441c-bfbd-e3ec84ea349f"}
