applicableAreas":["All transformer pad locations"],"sheetReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":21},{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":9}],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"Fences are shown on the site plan but are not located immediately adjacent to transformer pads. Measured clearances to fenced areas are well beyond 3-5 foot minimums required.","agentTrace":{"observation":"Examined site plan and electrical plan to identify fence locations relative to transformer pads. Fences exist on site but are not positioned directly adjacent to any transformer pad.","reasoning":"While fences are present on the site, they do not appear to be located at the minimum clearance distances from any transformer pad, suggesting adequate separation or that the applicability condition is not triggered.","tools_used":[]}},{"deficiencyId":"EL-13.4","status":"n/a","codeCitations":["UCM § 1.10.4 Table 1.10.4 footnote 2"],"applicableAreas":[],"sheetReferences":[],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"No clearances less than 5 feet to buildings are shown or documented as intentional design features requiring reduced clearance exception.","agentTrace":{"observation":"All measured transformer pad clearances from buildings are 6.7 feet or greater, exceeding the 5-foot minimum by at least 1.7 feet.","reasoning":"The applicability condition (clearances shown as less than 5 feet) is not met. No reduced clearances are documented, so this exception requirement is not triggered.","tools_used":["vision"]}},{"deficiencyId":"EL-13.5","status":"n/a","codeCitations":["UCM § 1.10.4 Table 1.10.4"],"applicableAreas":[],"sheetReferences":[],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"No balconies or overhangs are shown directly above or adjacent to transformer pad locations.","agentTrace":{"observation":"Reviewed building elevation and site plan sheets. Transformer pads are located in open areas without overhead structures.","reasoning":"No building