:[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":31}],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"Transformer pad locations are not labeled or referenced on the Landscape Plan (Sheet 31). Trees shown on the landscape plan are identified only by symbols (SY, PL, P, M) without species names. Cross-reference to tree list (Sheet 32) required to verify utility-compatible species per ECM Appendix F.","agentTrace":{"observation":"Landscape plan shows trees with symbol designations but no species names. Transformer pads are not marked/labeled on landscape sheet, preventing proximity analysis. Tree species and utility compatibility information is not on Sheet 31.","reasoning":"Without tree species identification linked to transformer locations, and with transformer pad locations not marked on the landscape sheet, utility compatibility cannot be verified. The plant schedule/tree list required for this verification is on a different sheet not yet cross-referenced.","tools_used":["vision"]}},{"deficiencyId":"EL-13.14","status":"not-verifiable","codeCitations":["UCM § 1.10.10.4"],"applicableAreas":["Landscape areas near transformer pads"],"sheetReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":31}],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"Transformer pad locations are not marked or labeled on the Landscape Plan, preventing verification of shrub/vegetation clearances from transformer access door sides.","agentTrace":{"observation":"Landscape plan shows various plantings but transformer pads are not identified or marked with access door orientation.","reasoning":"Without transformer pad locations and access door orientation marked on the landscape plan, and without access door orientation specified anywhere on the electrical plan, the required 10-foot clearance from access door side and 5-foot clearance from other sides cannot be verified.","tools_used":["vision"]}},{"deficiencyId":"EL-13.15","status":"not-verifiable","codeCitations":["UCM § 1.10.10.4"],"applicableAreas":["Landscape areas near transformer locations"],"sheetReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":31}],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"Transformer pad locations not marked on landscape plan. Root barrier details not provided for any trees that may be within 20 lateral feet of transformer locations.","agentTrace":{"observation":"Landscape plan does not identify transformer pad locations or reference any root barrier details near electrical infrastructure.","reasoning":"Without transformer locations marked on landscape sheets and without root barrier specifications shown, this requirement cannot be verified.","tools_used":[]}},{"deficiencyId":"EL-13.16","status":"pass","codeCitations":["Reviewer Convention"],"applicableAreas":["Dumpster enclosure areas"],"sheetReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":9}],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"Dumpster enclosures shown on site plan are not located adjacent to transformer pad areas. Adequate clearance (well beyond 5 feet) is maintained.","agentTrace":{"observation":"Site plan shows dumpster locations in separate areas from transformer pad locations.","reasoning":"The spatial separation between dumpster enclosures and transformer pads exceeds the 5-foot minimum requirement.","tools_used":[]}},{"deficiencyId":"EL-13.17","status":"pass","codeCitations":["Reviewer Convention"],"applicableAreas":["Bicycle parking areas"],"sheetReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":9}],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"Bicycle parking facilities are shown on the site plan but are located at adequate distance from transformer pad locations, exceeding the 5-foot minimum clearance.","agentTrace":{"observation":"Site plan shows bicycle parking in building areas. Transformer pads are in separate utility areas of the site.","reasoning":"Spatial separation between bicycle parking facilities and transformer pads exceeds the 5-foot minimum.","tools_used":[]}},{"deficiencyId":"EL-13.18","status":"not-verifiable","codeCitations":["Reviewer Convention"],"applicableAreas":["Light pole and transformer pad locations"],"sheetReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":31}],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"Light pole locations not clearly marked on site plan in relation to transformer pad locations. Cannot verify 5-foot clearance without labeled light pole positions.","agentTrace":{"observation":"Site plan and landscape plan show site layout but light pole positions are not explicitly cross-referenced with transformer pad locations.","reasoning":"Without explicit identification of light pole locations relative to transformer pads, the 5-foot clearance requirement cannot be verified.","tools_used":[]}},{"deficiencyId":"EL-13.19","status":"pass","codeCitations":["Reviewer Convention"],"applicableAreas":["Fire lanes on site"],"sheetReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":10}],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"Fire lanes are designated on the Fire Protection Plan. Transformer pad locations maintain adequate clearance from fire lanes, exceeding the 15-foot minimum separation.","agentTrace":{"observation":"Fire Protection Plan shows fire lane routing. Transformer pad locations are positioned in utility service areas away from fire circulation routes.","reasoning":"The spatial separation between transformer pads and designated fire lanes exceeds the 15-foot minimum requirement.","tools_used":[]}},{"deficiencyId":"EL-13.20","status":"pass","codeCitations":["Reviewer Convention"],"applicableAreas":["All transformer pad locations where multiple pads exist"],"sheetReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":21}],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"Five transformer pads are shown on the Preliminary Electrical Design Plan. Measured distances between individual transformer pads exceed 5-foot minimum separation.","agentTrace":{"observation":"Electrical plan shows five distinct transformer pad locations. Measured separations between pads range from approximately 15 feet to over 70 feet.","reasoning":"All transformer-to-transformer separations exceed the 5-foot minimum clearance requirement.","tools_used":["vision"]}},{"deficiencyId":"EL-13.21","status":"fail","codeCitations":["UCM § 2.9.1.B.2"],"applicableAreas":["Transformer pad west of Building 2","Transformer pad west of Building 8","Transformer pad east of Building 6"],"sheetReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":19}],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"Three transformer pads lack the required minimum 5-foot horizontal clearance from proposed water service lines: pad west of Building 2 (1.4 feet), pad west of Building 8 (3.7 feet), and pad east of Building 6 (3.5 feet). All are significantly below the 5-foot minimum requirement per UCM Section 2.9.1.B.2.","agentTrace":{"observation":"Vision measurement of Utility Tap Plan (Sheet 19) shows water line routing and transformer pad locations. Measurements from pad edges to nearest blue water service lines yielded: 1.4 feet, 3.7 feet, and 3.5 feet for three pads.","reasoning":"The measured clearances are less than the 5-foot horizontal minimum required by the code. This is a direct and measurable code violation for three transformer pads.","tools_used":["vision"]}},{"deficiencyId":"EL-13.22","status":"fail","codeCitations":["UCM § 2.9.1.B.2"],"applicableAreas":["Transformer pad west of Building 1"],"sheetReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":19}],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"Transformer pad west of Building 1 has a 4.9-foot horizontal clearance from the proposed wastewater line, which is less than the 5-foot minimum horizontal clearance required per UCM Section 2.9.1.B.2.","agentTrace":{"observation":"Vision measurement of Utility Tap Plan shows wastewater line