ination.","tools_used":[]}},{"deficiencyId":"EL-13.36","status":"not-verifiable","codeCitations":["UCM § 1.10.4 Table 1.10.4 footnote 4"],"applicableAreas":["Electrical routing from transformer to meter locations"],"sheetReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":21}],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"Electrical routing from proposed transformer pads to meter locations is shown on the Preliminary Electrical Design Plan but routing paths are not clearly marked or verified as 100% on private property. Routing across property boundaries or near property lines cannot be excluded without explicit labeling.","agentTrace":{"observation":"Electrical plan shows transformer and meter locations with connecting electrical lines but does not explicitly label which portions are on private vs. public property.","reasoning":"Without explicit property boundary notation or labels confirming electrical routing is entirely on private property, this requirement cannot be definitively verified as compliant.","tools_used":[]}},{"deficiencyId":"EL-13.37","status":"not-verifiable","codeCitations":["UCM § 1.5.2.6","UCM § 1.18.0 (obtain transformer pad detail from AE Design)"],"applicableAreas":["All transformer pad locations"],"sheetReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":21}],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"Transformer pad dimensions (length, width, height) are not provided on the Preliminary Electrical Design Plan. Plans do not reference or include Austin Energy Design-approved transformer pad detail sheets that specify exact dimensions for the proposed service type (single-phase or three-phase). Pad dimensions cannot be verified as matching AE Design standards.","agentTrace":{"observation":"Electrical plan (Sheet 21) shows transformer pad locations with symbols but no dimension callouts or reference to detail sheets. No AE Design-approved pad details are included in the submitted plan set.","reasoning":"The grouping explicitly states pad dimensions are determined by AE Design on a project-specific basis and are not standardized. The absence of dimension callouts and AE Design detail references means compliance cannot be verified. This is likely a preliminary design issue to be resolved during detailed design/permitting.","tools_used":[]}},{"deficiencyId":"EL-13.38","status":"pass","codeCitations":["UCM § 1.10.4 Table 1.10.4"],"applicableAreas":["Transformer pad locations relative to parking areas and vehicle circulation"],"sheetReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":21}],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"All transformer pads are located more than 4 feet from parking areas and vehicle circulation routes. Measured distances range from 16 feet to 85.3 feet. Since no pads are within the 4-foot trigger distance, bollards are not required per this standard.","agentTrace":{"observation":"Measured distances from all transformer pads to nearest parking or traffic areas: 32.2 feet, 16 feet, 31.2 feet, 74.4 feet, and 85.3 feet.","reasoning":"All clearances exceed the 4-foot threshold that triggers bollard requirement. Bollards are not required where pads are adequately separated from traffic areas.","tools_used":["vision"]}},{"deficiencyId":"EL-13.39","status":"pass","codeCitations":["UCM § 1.10.3"],"applicableAreas":["Building and site structure locations relative to overhead distribution"],"sheetReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":21}],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"No overhead distribution facilities are shown on site. All electrical service is provided via underground lines. No customer buildings, parking garages, light poles, signs, billboards, chimneys, antennas, or tanks are installed under or over Austin Energy overhead distribution facilities.","agentTrace":{"observation":"Site plan and electrical plan show no overhead distribution infrastructure on the property.","reasoning":"The applicability condition (overhead distribution facilities present) is not met.","tools_used":[]}}]},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":7,"cache_creation_input_tokens":341,"cache_read_input_tokens":75221,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":341},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"64cdee63-31dd-4baa-841a-32fa24fe3ff6","uuid":"de1581bd-38df-4957-a237-7c76186fdcde"}
