, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7, and 8).\n\n### Location Relative to Trees Visible on Sheet 21:\nWhile proposed trees from Sheet 31 are not visible, Sheet 21 depicts numerous *existing* trees using large, faint, wavy circular outlines. \n*   The **\"Underground Electric Line\"** network directly intersects and routes through the canopies of multiple existing trees, particularly along the northern property line above Bldgs 1 and 3, along the western sidewalk easement next to Bldgs 2 and 8, and along the eastern and southern edges of the site.\n*   Several **\"Electrical Pull Box\"** locations and **\"Electrical Transformer Pad\"** locations appear to sit within or directly on the edge of these existing tree canopy outlines."}]}
