{"level":30,"time":1778524284694,"pid":86444,"hostname":"Williams-MacBook-Pro.local","step":"review-runs","item":"2.md","index":7,"runIndex":"run-3","type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_01BDP9sRdVdPmQDfmcbKLxEp","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Good information. The electrical plan shows:\n1. Underground electric lines (blue lines)\n2. Pull boxes (small blue squares)\n3. Transformer pads (blue rectangles)\n4. Vault easement\n5. Electrical meters\n\nMultiple pull boxes are near or underneath existing trees, and some are located in areas where the landscaping plan shows proposed trees.\n\nNow let me check if there's any information about Austin Energy approval for trees near electric facilities, and then I'll compile all the findings.\n\nKey deficiencies so far:\n1. **EL-2.1** - NOT-VERIFIABLE: Non-utility-compatible trees within 15 ft of OHE distribution - cannot verify without species IDs and ECM Appendix F reference\n2. **EL-2.3** - NOT-VERIFIABLE: Large trees (≥40 ft) within 25 ft of OHE distribution - cannot verify without mature height info\n3. **EL-2.6** - FAIL: Trees within 10 ft of utility pole at southeast corner\n4. **EL-2.7** - FAIL/NOT-VERIFIABLE: Trees within 10 ft of pad-mounted equipment (at least Location 1 near Bldg 1 has trees very close)\n5. **EL-2.8** - NOT-VERIFIABLE: Trees within 5 ft of underground equipment - cannot verify without detailed distance measurements\n6. **EL-2.9** - NOT-VERIFIABLE: Trees within 20 ft of underground equipment lack root barriers - no root barrier details shown\n7. **EL-2.10** - FAIL: Mitigation trees species not identified\n8. **EL-2.11** - FAIL: Large trees not differentiated (no mature heights shown, only installation heights)\n9. **EL-2.15** - NOT-VERIFIABLE: No documented Austin Energy approval shown for trees in restricted zones\n\nLet me check if there are any supplementary documents that show Austin Energy approval.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":7,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1313,"cache_read_input_tokens":67437,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1313},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"dedcba6e-469f-4ff1-8623-d3aaae962125","uuid":"5db21251-3813-463a-b56f-07e0b6b5a3be"}
