 locations"],"sheetReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":9},{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":19},{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":21}],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"Transformer pad locations are shown on separate plan sheets (Site Plan, Electrical Plan) but are not overlaid with utility line routing on a single sheet showing the relationship between transformer pads and underground/overhead utility locations. Cannot verify that transformers or AE facilities are not located over/under other utility lines or building structures.","agentTrace":{"observation":"Transformer pads are depicted on Sheets 9 and 21, while utilities are shown on Sheet 19. These sheets are not overlaid to verify conflicts.","reasoning":"Verification of cross-utility conflicts and placement over/under other infrastructure requires overlay of transformer locations with utility and building structure locations, which is not provided.","tools_used":[]}},{"deficiencyId":"EL-13.27","status":"n/a","codeCitations":["UCM § 1.10.3"],"applicableAreas":[],"sheetReferences":[],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"No overhead distribution lines are shown on or near the property. Utilities are served by underground lines. The requirement does not apply.","agentTrace":{"observation":"Site plan and utility plan review shows underground utility service with no overhead distribution conductors shown on or adjacent to the property.","reasoning":"This requirement is conditionally applicable only when overhead distribution lines are present. Underground service is provided.","tools_used":[]}},{"deficiencyId":"EL-13.28","status":"n/a","codeCitations":["UCM § 1.10.3"],"applicableAreas":[],"sheetReferences":[],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"No overhead distribution primary or neutral conductors are shown on the property. Underground electric service is provided. The requirement does not apply.","agentTrac