an but no annotations explicitly state they are located on private property. Plat sheet shows easements and property boundaries.","reasoning":"Verification requires explicit confirmation that each transformer pad's entire footprint is on private property and not in ROW. This confirmation is not provided.","tools_used":[]}},{"deficiencyId":"EL-13.34","status":"not-verifiable","codeCitations":["UCM § 1.10.4 Table 1.10.4 footnote 4"],"applicableAreas":["All transformer pad locations"],"sheetReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":9},{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":11},{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":2}],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"Facts.md indicates multiple recorded easements including drainage easements, wastewater easements, electric easements, and water easements. Site plan depicts easements but transformer pad locations are not explicitly annotated as being outside prohibited easement areas or noting AE Design written approvals for any easement encroachments.","agentTrace":{"observation":"Project facts document confirms existence of multiple easements (drainage, wastewater, water, electric). Site plan shows these easements, but transformer locations are not explicitly cross-referenced to confirm they avoid prohibited easement areas.","reasoning":"Compliance requires explicit verification that transformer pads are not located in drainage, water, sewer, or overhead electric easements except with AE Design written approval. This verification is not documented.","tools_used":[]}},{"deficiencyId":"EL-13.35","status":"not-verifiable","codeCitations":["UCM § 1.10.3"],"applicableAreas":["All transformer pad locations"],"sheetReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":9},{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":21}],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"Transformer pad easements are not explicitly s