rences to Austin Energy Design-approved transformer pad detail sheets are provided. Pad dimensions must be confirmed against AE Design specifications for the service type and load.","agentTrace":{"observation":"Vision review of Sheets 9 and 21 confirms that transformer pads are shown with no dimensional callouts (e.g., '5x5', '8x8') and no references to AE Design detail sheets or service type specifications.","reasoning":"The requirement mandates that pad dimensions match AE Design-approved details for the specified service type. Without any dimensions labeled and no AE Design detail references, this requirement cannot be met.","tools_used":["vision_check"]}},{"deficiencyId":"EL-13.38","status":"fail","codeCitations":["UCM § 1.10.4 Table 1.10.4"],"applicableAreas":["Transformer pad west of Building 2 / near parking area"],"sheetReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":9}],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"One transformer pad is located within 4 feet of the vehicle circulation route and parking area (abutting the main driveway). No bollard protection is shown around this transformer pad. Bollards are shown elsewhere on the site plan (near units 301, 405, 705), confirming the drafter's knowledge of bollard notation. Required 4-inch minimum diameter galvanized rigid metal posts must be added to protect the transformer pad within the 4-foot parking/vehicle circulation zone.","agentTrace":{"observation":"Vision measurement of the transformer pad west of Building 2 shows it positioned immediately adjacent to (within 4 feet of) the primary vehicle circulation aisle. Vision review confirms no bollard symbols are drawn at this transformer pad location, though bollard symbols are visible elsewhere on the site plan.","reasoning":"The transformer pad is within the 4-foot triggering distance from parking/vehicle routes, requiring bollard protection per AE Design details. The absence of bollards at this pad while they are shown at other locations on the site constitutes a deficiency.","tools_used":["vision_check"]}},{"deficiencyId":"EL-13.39","status":"n/a","codeCitations":["UCM § 1.10.3"],"applicableAreas":[],"sheetReferences":[],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"No overhead distribution facilities are present on the property. Underground electric service is provided. No customer structures are proposed to be installed under or over Austin Energy overhead distribution lines. The requirement does not apply.","agentTrace":{"observation":"Utility and site plans confirm underground electric service with no overhead distribution lines shown.","reasoning":"This requirement applies only when overhead distribution facilities are present. The project has underground electrical service.","tools_used":[]}}]},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":7,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1834,"cache_read_input_tokens":69846,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1834},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"5715fb31-121d-49ba-8cec-d078a95e28e1","uuid":"8cff5524-9c2d-4728-9d5a-4c33218a4ebc"}
