{"level":30,"time":1778524284695,"pid":86444,"hostname":"Williams-MacBook-Pro.local","step":"review-runs","item":"13.md","index":8,"runIndex":"run-3","type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_0137rvnguFqXdBFFdpLXwhQL","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I've completed the comprehensive site plan review for grouping 13 (Transformer Pad Clearances and Location Requirements). Here's a summary of my findings:\n\n## Review Summary\n\n**Total Checklist Items Evaluated:** 39\n\n**Findings Breakdown:**\n- **Pass:** 2 items (measured clearances from buildings exceed 5-foot minimum)\n- **Fail:** 2 items (missing dimensions/AE Design details; missing bollards at transformer near parking)\n- **Not-Verifiable:** 17 items (insufficient dimensions, transformer locations not shown on relevant sheets)\n- **N/A:** 18 items (conditions don't apply: no retaining walls, fences, niches, overhead lines, gas service, etc.)\n\n## Key Deficiencies Found\n\n**EL-13.37 - FAIL:** Transformer pad dimensions do not match Austin Energy Design specifications\n- No dimensions (width/length) are labeled on any plan sheet\n- No reference to AE Design-approved transformer pad detail sheets\n- Service type (single-phase/three-phase) not identified\n- **Required action:** Provide transformer pad dimensions and reference applicable AE Design detail sheets\n\n**EL-13.38 - FAIL:** Equipment pad within 4 feet of parking area lacks bollard protection\n- One transformer pad is located immediately adjacent to the primary vehicle circulation aisle/parking area (within 4 feet)\n- No bollard symbols are shown at this transformer pad\n- Bollards ARE shown elsewhere on the site plan (confirming the drafter knows how to show them)\n- **Required action:** Add 4-inch minimum diameter galvanized rigid metal posts (bollards) around the transformer pad in the parking/vehicle circulation zone\n\n## Major Data Gaps Preventing Verification\n\n1. **Clearance 