rement.","agentTrace":{"observation":"Vision measurement of two transformer pads on Sheet 9 shows distances of 12.8 feet and 8 feet from the nearest building exterior walls.","reasoning":"Both measured distances exceed the 5-foot minimum clearance threshold specified in the code. The requirement is satisfied for the measured transformer pads.","tools_used":["vision_check"]}},{"deficiencyId":"EL-13.2","status":"n/a","codeCitations":["Reviewer Convention"],"applicableAreas":[],"sheetReferences":[],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"No retaining walls are adjacent to transformer pads. The requirement does not apply.","agentTrace":{"observation":"Examination of site plan (Sheet 9) and grading plan (Sheet 11) shows retaining walls located around site perimeter and pond, but none adjacent to transformer pad locations.","reasoning":"The item is conditionally applicable only when retaining walls are present adjacent to transformer pads. No such proximity exists on this project.","tools_used":["vision_check"]}},{"deficiencyId":"EL-13.3","status":"n/a","codeCitations":["UCM § 1.10.4 Table 1.10.4"],"applicableAreas":[],"sheetReferences":[],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"No fences or gates are adjacent to transformer pads. The requirement does not apply.","agentTrace":{"observation":"Site plan review shows no fence lines or gates in proximity to any transformer pad locations.","reasoning":"This requirement is conditionally applicable only when fences/gates are adjacent to transformer pads. No such condition exists on this project.","tools_used":[]}},{"deficiencyId":"EL-13.4","status":"not-verifiable","codeCitations":["UCM § 1.10.4 Table 1.10.4 footnote 2"],"applicableAreas":["All transformer pad locations"],"sheetReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":9},{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":21}],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"No clearance dimensions are labeled on the site plan or electrical plan. Cannot verify whether clearances less than 5 feet are present or whether required AE Design written approval and fire rating documentation are provided.","agentTrace":{"observation":"Vision review of Sheets 9 and 21 confirms no numerical dimension callouts specifying clearances from transformer pads to buildings are provided.","reasoning":"Without specific dimension callouts, it cannot be determined whether any transformer pads have reduced clearances requiring AE Design approval. The requirement cannot be evaluated.","tools_used":["vision_check"]}},{"deficiencyId":"EL-13.5","status":"n/a","codeCitations":["UCM § 1.10.4 Table 1.10.4"],"applicableAreas":[],"sheetReferences":[],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"No balconies or overhangs are shown above or adjacent to transformer pads. No covering or structure is directly above transformer pads. The requirement does not apply.","agentTrace":{"observation":"Site plan and grading plan review shows no building overhangs, balconies, or structures positioned above transformer pad locations.","reasoning":"This requirement is conditionally applicable only when balconies or overhangs are present. No such condition exists.","tools_used":[]}},{"deficiencyId":"EL-13.6","status":"not-verifiable","codeCitations":["UCM § 1.10.4 Table 1.10.4"],"applicableAreas":["All transformer pad locations"],"sheetReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":9},{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":21}],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"Transformer equipment type (oil-filled vs. dry-type) is not specified on the plans. No dimension callouts show clearance distances from windows, doors, or ventilating ducts. Requirement applicability and compliance cannot be verified.","agentTrace":{"observation":"Electrical plan notes and site plan do not specify whether transformers are oil-filled or dry-type, and no dimensions are provided for clearances to building windows, doors, or ducts.","reaso