":"Transformer pads are not shown on the fire protection plan. No fire escape or stair locations are identified relative to transformer pads. Equipment type (oil-filled) is not specified. Cannot verify 20-foot clearance requirement.","agentTrace":{"observation":"Fire protection plan (Sheet 10) does not depict transformer pads, and no fire escape locations are shown on sheets containing transformer pads.","reasoning":"Fire escape clearances apply specifically to oil-filled equipment, which is not identified on these plans. The requirement cannot be evaluated without knowing equipment type and fire escape proximity.","tools_used":["vision_check"]}},{"deficiencyId":"EL-13.10","status":"not-verifiable","codeCitations":["UCM § 1.10.4 Table 1.10.4"],"applicableAreas":["All transformer pad locations"],"sheetReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":9},{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":21}],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"Transformer pad access door sides are not oriented or labeled on any plan sheet. Clearance distances to open area or buildings are not dimensioned for most pads. Only one measurement of 54.1 feet was obtained; insufficient data to verify all pads meet 10-foot minimum.","agentTrace":{"observation":"Vision review of electrical and site plans shows transformer pads with no access door orientation indicators or dimensions from pad edges to buildings/open areas.","reasoning":"Without access door orientation and specific distance callouts for each pad, compliance with the 10-foot clearance requirement cannot be verified for all transformer locations.","tools_used":["vision_check"]}},{"deficiencyId":"EL-13.11","status":"n/a","codeCitations":["UCM § 1.10.4 Table 1.10.4"],"applicableAreas":[],"sheetReferences":[],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"No transformer locations are within niches, vaults, or enclosed areas on 3+ sides. The requirement does not apply.","agentTrace":{"observation":"Si