transformers cannot be evaluated.","tools_used":[]}},{"deficiencyId":"EL-13.14","status":"not-verifiable","codeCitations":["UCM § 1.10.10.4"],"applicableAreas":["All transformer pad locations"],"sheetReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":31}],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"Transformer pad locations are not shown on the landscape plan. Shrub and groundcover planting locations cannot be cross-referenced to transformer pads to verify 10-foot and 5-foot clearances.","agentTrace":{"observation":"Transformer pads are not depicted on the landscape plan (Sheet 31), preventing verification of vegetation clearances.","reasoning":"Cross-referencing between vegetation locations and transformer access door orientation requires transformer symbols on the landscape plan, which are absent.","tools_used":[]}},{"deficiencyId":"EL-13.15","status":"not-verifiable","codeCitations":["UCM § 1.10.10.4"],"applicableAreas":["All transformer pad locations"],"sheetReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":31},{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":37}],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"Transformer pad locations are not shown on the landscape plan or detail sheets. Trees within 20 lateral feet cannot be identified, and root barrier details specific to transformer equipment cannot be verified.","agentTrace":{"observation":"Vision review of landscape plan and detail sheets shows no transformer pad symbols.","reasoning":"Without transformer locations identified on the landscape plan, the 20-foot tree proximity trigger and required root barrier specifications cannot be evaluated.","tools_used":[]}},{"deficiencyId":"EL-13.16","status":"n/a","codeCitations":["Reviewer Convention"],"applicableAreas":[],"sheetReferences":[],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"No dumpsters or trash enclosures are adjacent to transformer pad locations. The requirement does not apply.","agentTrace":{"observation":"Site plan review shows trash collection areas, but no dumpster or trash enclosure is positioned adjacent to transformer pads.","reasoning":"This requirement is conditionally applicable only when dumpsters are present adjacent to transformers. No such condition exists.","tools_used":[]}},{"deficiencyId":"EL-13.17","status":"n/a","codeCitations":["Reviewer Convention"],"applicableAreas":[],"sheetReferences":[],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"No bike racks are adjacent to transformer pad locations. The requirement does not apply.","agentTrace":{"observation":"Bicycle parking is shown on the site plan within building garages, but no bike racks are positioned adjacent to transformer pads.","reasoning":"This requirement is conditionally applicable only when bike racks are adjacent to transformers. No such condition exists.","tools_used":[]}},{"deficiencyId":"EL-13.18","status":"n/a","codeCitations":["Reviewer Convention"],"applicableAreas":[],"sheetReferences":[],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"No light poles are adjacent to transformer pad locations. The requirement does not apply.","agentTrace":{"observation":"Site plan shows lighting locations but no light poles are positioned adjacent to transformer pads.","reasoning":"This requirement is conditionally applicable only when light poles are adjacent to transformers. No such condition exists.","tools_used":[]}},{"deficiencyId":"EL-13.19","status":"not-verifiable","codeCitations":["Reviewer Convention"],"applicableAreas":["Transformer pad locations"],"sheetReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":10}],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"Transformer pads are not shown on the fire protection plan (Sheet 10). Fire lane locations are documented (26 feet wide, 27.3 feet in one section) but no dimension callouts relate transformer pads to fire lane edges. Cannot verify 15-foot clearance.","agentTrace":{"observation":"Fire protection plan (Sheet 10) shows fire lanes but does not depict transformer pad locations.","reasoning":"The distance between transformer pads and fire lanes cannot be determined without transformer symbols shown on the fire protection plan.","tools_used":["vision_check"]}},{"deficiencyId":"EL-13.20","status":"not-verifiable","codeCitations":["Reviewer Convention"],"applicableAreas":["All transformer pad locations"],"sheetReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":21}],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"Five transformer pads are shown on the electrical plan, but no dimension callouts specify distances between individual pads. Cannot verify 5-foot separation between transformer pads.","agentTrace":{"observation":"Electrical plan shows five transformer pad locations but no dimensions are provided between adjacent pads.","reasoning":"Without specific distance callouts between transformer pads, compliance with 5-foot separation cannot be verified.","tools_used":["vision_check"]}},{"deficiencyId":"EL-13.21","status":"not-verifiable","codeCitations":["UCM § 2.9.1.B.2"],"applicableAreas":["All transformer pad locations"],"sheetReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":19}],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"Utility plan (Sheet 19) shows water line routing but transformer pad locations are not depicted on this sheet. No dimension callouts specify distance from water lines to transformer pads. Cannot verify 5-foot horizontal clearance.","agentTrace":{"observation":"Utility plan (Sheet 19) shows water utility routing and includes transformer pad symbol in legend but does not depict any transformer pads in the drawing.","reasoning":"Without transformer pad locations shown on the utility plan, the separation distance to water lines cannot be evaluated.","tools_used":["vision_check"]}},{"deficiencyId":"EL-13.22","status":"not-verifiable","codeCitations":["UCM § 2.9.1.B.2"],"applicableAreas":["All transformer pad locations"],"sheetReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b1